From d8bf6a0a46b8913d55527be2258946dec354b7d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 20:23:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] Rebuild telemetry on the Cloudflare Worker with live
 presence
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replaces the shared-JSONBin approach (whose master key had to ship in the
public client, so anyone could read or wipe the logs) with a proper
worker-backed design:

Worker (KV-backed):
- POST /track stores a heartbeat: a short-TTL session:<sid> key for
  presence, and a user:<name> rollup refreshed on 'open'. Coarse geo
  (Cloudflare country/region) is kept, never a raw IP.
- GET /admin/summary returns active-now (sessions still within TTL,
  collapsed per user) plus all-time users, but ONLY to a request whose
  ?token= matches env.ADMIN_TOKEN. That server-side check is the real,
  owner-only access control — no secret is exposed to the browser.
- POST /admin/clear wipes logs (same token gate).
- Degrades cleanly: no KV bound -> /track no-ops; no ADMIN_TOKEN ->
  admin endpoints return a helpful 500; the OpenAI proxy and /read are
  untouched.

Client:
- Every instance heartbeats to /track on open and every 45s while signed
  in (text/plain body = no CORS preflight, keepalive for the unload
  beat). Controlled by a top-level TELEMETRY_ENABLED constant.
- Admin console Usage tab gains a Live view: an "active right now" count,
  the active users with host/region/last-seen, and all-time users with
  open counts, plus auto-refresh. Admin token is entered once and kept on
  the owner's device only.
- One-time end-user disclosure notice retained.

Tested: worker handlers against a mock KV (track, token auth, presence
expiry, per-open counting, clear, graceful degradation, proxy intact);
client heartbeat payload and live view rendering in Chromium against a
mocked worker, including the wrong-token error path and the disclosure
notice.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019GqTQm8E1znRkM37YVj6K7
